 },
 "summary": "XH is JST's single-row wire-to-board system on a 2.5 mm pitch. Wires are crimped into SXH contacts that load into an XHP plug housing, which mates with a box-shaped shrouded header on the board; the contact is a double-leaf design and the mated height above the board is 9.8 mm. B4B-XH-A is the 4-circuit through-hole top-entry header, white PA 66 wafer, 0.64 mm square tin-plated brass posts, mating with the XHP-4 housing; the 4-circuit size meets the JEMA HA terminal standard. The range runs from 1 to 20 circuits in top-entry, bossed, side-entry, glass-filled, SMT and radial-taped versions, rated 3 A and 250 V AC/DC from -25 to +85 °C.",
